    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569010/extras/58a693522e6520eba81db8dcf440148d.avif?t=1755550127\" width=620 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've always dreamt of owning your own <strong>sexy robot</strong>. With the national Smashdoll championships now taking place, you decide to take the plunge and sell everything you own to buy your own bot and shoot your shot for ultimate glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smashdolls is a turn-based combat game where your <strong>customized</strong> robot is thrust into the arena to fight in classic <strong>strategy combat</strong>. Explore the city and discover dozens of <strong>hot girls</strong> to battle to win new parts and funds upgrade your ultimate robot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the hard-fought battles, get to know your fellow robot-enthusiasts a little more <strong>intimately</strong>, or juice your robot up in some <strong>hands-on\u00a0</strong>recharging with extensive <strong>fully-animated</strong> hentai sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569010/extras/b0c193ac00d4d9fb9fe65eccf3ba9195.poster.avif?t=1755550127\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569010/extras/b0c193ac00d4d9fb9fe65eccf3ba9195.webm?t=1755550127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569010/extras/d6f84849e3961efb40804a8bfb196c9c.avif?t=1755550127\" width=620 height=234 /></span>Choose from dozens of bots. Swap out any part. Discover new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ cute and sexy robots to battle, collect and fuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ erotic NPCs prepared to bare all when defeated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle 'Futa Mode' to unleash the meat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle 'Streamer Mode' and play it safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a male or female player character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal and silicone clash in two game modes: DUEL and TOURNAMENT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle 1-v-1 in local multiplayer or steam remote play together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully optimized for Steam Deck &amp; Controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements, trading cards and community items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom full illustration by DankoDeadZone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a gallery full of concept art, game art and guest art!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
